sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Administrator
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as Backend
    participant M as Email
    participant DB as AdminSession
    A->>UI: Email and password
    UI->>API: POST login (5 per 15 min)
    API->>API: Check ADMIN_EMAIL and bcrypt hash
    API->>M: Email a 6-digit code (hashed, 10 min)
    API-->>UI: Code sent
    A->>UI: Enter the code
    UI->>API: POST verify-otp (3 per 10 min)
    API->>DB: Create session (token hash, IP)
    API-->>UI: admin_token cookie, httpOnly, 30 min
    loop Every admin request
        UI->>API: Cookie sent
        API->>API: Verify ADMIN_JWT_SECRET signature
        API->>DB: Session found, active, not idle
    end
